  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Democracy and Human Rights in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This three-year project includes interconnected components of Democracy and Human Rights. The project main objectives are 1) to consolidate and strenghten democratic process and institutional practices in Mozambique. 2) to strenghten the Rule of Law and the protection of Human Rights, by improving access to justice, stregthening the capacities of Human rights nechnisms and institutions.
The Democracy componet focuses on ensuring the credibility of the electoral institutions and processes, achored on principles of transparency, inclusiveness, accountability, and neutrality.
The Human rights componets focuses on improving access to justice, increasing safety and security, and enhancing the protection and the promotion of human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
